# @halt, @restart and @chown reports: do_halt / do_halt1 / do_haltpid / do_restart_com
# (pennmush src/cque.c:2160-2449) and do_chown (src/set.c:177-239).

::case hc.chown  a successful @chown says "Owner changed."
::login alice Alice alicepass
::as alice
@create HC1
@create HC2
::login wiz Wiz wizpass
::as wiz
@chown [locate(*Alice,HC1,i)]=me

::case hc.halt-own  halting your own object reports to you, its owner, and sets HALT
@halt [locate(*Alice,HC1,i)]
think [hasflag(locate(*Alice,HC1,i),HALT)]

::case hc.halt-others  halting someone else's object tells both of you
@halt [locate(*Alice,HC2,i)]

::case hc.halt-player  halting a player halts everything they own
@halt *Alice

::case hc.halt-self  @halt alone and @halt me
::as alice
@halt
@halt me

::case hc.halt-pid  a pid that is not a number, or no queue entry's
::as wiz
@halt/pid abc
@halt/pid 999999

::case hc.restart  @restart reports before it halts
@restart [locate(*Alice,HC1,i)]
@restart *Alice
